# Copy to .dev.vars (gitignored) for local secrets. Nothing is required: the built-in samples, the archive API and
# summaries (rule-based without Workers AI) run with no keys and no Cloudflare login.
#
# Optional, only for `pnpm bake:summaries` (scripts/bake-sample-summaries.ts), which bakes Workers AI one-liners
# into the samples. The token needs the "Workers AI: Read" permission. The Worker itself never reads these: in
# production it uses the `AI` binding (wrangler.jsonc; local dev uses wrangler.local.jsonc, without it).
# CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=
# CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=
